  "duration_s": 446.827586,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "你十四岁那年在干啥？是不是还在爹妈跟前撒娇，考试，考砸了怕挨揍。可一九零二年湖北黄冈有个十四岁的穷小子，干了一件事，把自己的名字填错了。这孩子叫李仲坎爹，是个穷教书匠，家里穷的叮当响，连去武昌赶考的路费都是东拼西凑几了，借来的。到了考场填报名表，他太紧张，了手一抖，把年龄十四两个字写进了姓名栏。等他回过神坏了，再买一张表，兜里的钱只够买这一张。你猜这孩子怎么办？他不慌盯着那个十字，看了半天，提笔添了几笔兴生生，把十改成了笔姓，有了名，还空着。他一抬头，看见厅堂上方挂着一块匾，上写光背四表四个大字。他摘下最后一个光子，随手把自己的名字定成了李四光一张填错的表，一个将错就错的名字。谁能想到这个穷小子情急之下改的名字，日后会刻进新中国的史册，名字是错的。可他这辈子走的路一步都没走错。李四光小时候跟着爹念私塾，有一回在村口玩儿，看见一块孤零零的大石头比人还高。他就跑去问先生，这石头是从哪儿来的？先生答不上来，就这么一个问题。在他心里扎了根很多年后，他才明白自己这辈子就是想去回答一句话，脚下这片土地到底藏着什么？十五岁李四光公费去日本留学，学造船，为啥学造船？说出来扎心。那时候的中国海防烂得一塌糊涂，列强的军舰在长江里横冲直撞。跟逛自家后花园似的，一个十几岁的孩子心里憋着一口气，造船强国把海防守住。一九零五年，孙中山在东京筹建同盟会，李四光由孙中山亲自主盟，加入成了最年轻的创始会员之一。孙中山握着他的手，送了他八个字，努力向学未为国用这八个字，像烙铁一样烫进了他心里一趟就是一辈子。一九一零年毕业回国，辛亥革命一爆发，二十二岁的李四光当上了湖北军政府事业部部长。二十二岁呀，多大的官儿？搁今天那是省不级换做别人嗯，少年得志，那还不得飘起来。可李四光干了没多久，心就凉了。民国初年的官场乌烟瘴气，他算看明白了，光靠造几艘船办几个工厂，救不了这个病入膏肓的国家。于是，他做了一个让所有人都看不懂的决定，辞掉部长，一九一三年再去英国留学，放着好好的官不做，跑去洋人的地盘，从头学起屠杀。图的是国家缺什么？他就学什么？到了英国伯明汉大学，他先学采矿，为啥中国地大物博，可怜钢铁都要靠进口，要强国，先得把地底下的矿挖出来。可学了一年，他又发现一个更要命的问题。矿在哪？地底下到底埋着什么，怎么找？要找矿得先懂地制。于是他第二次转向从采矿转到地址。你看他这几步，造船、采矿、地质，哪一步是为了自己，哪一步是哪个热门学，哪个没有，全是国家缺什么，他就扑上去学什么，一个少年的名字是填表填错的。可他这一生的志向，一次都没填，错过。拿到硕士后，应蔡元培之邀李四光到北京大学当地质系教授。后来做了系主任，在北大，他干了三件事，渐渐打脸。洋人第一件研究停科化石停是一种早就灭绝的微小生物外壳。像纺锤不同年代长得不一样，李四光摸出一套鉴定方法，至今还在用。这东西有啥用？找煤的指南针，安徽一处煤矿眼看要踩空了，他捡到一块停化石，翻来覆去一看，底下还有煤，果然新煤田挖出来了。第二件第四季冰川，当时外国全民袁为一口咬定，中国东部气候温暖，不可能有冰川李四光偏不信这个邪。带着学生翻山越岭，太行山大统、黄山、庐山一路找过去，硬是找到了冰川遗迹，把洋人的定论翻了个底朝天。第三件创立地质力学，他把力学引进地质研究，提出构造体系。地壳上那些褶皱断裂，不是乱常的，是地底下应力挤压出来的。既然是挤出来的，就能算能推能预测这个想法，后来成了中国找矿找由的一把总钥匙。说到这儿，李四光已经是国际知名的大学者，在英国站稳了脚跟，半生的研究手稿都整理好了，就等出版人生到这儿，似乎可以圆满了。可就在这时，一九四九年新中国成立的消息从大洋彼岸传来，身在伦敦的李四光，一下子站到了人生最大的悬崖边上，国民党特务放出狠话。不公开声明，不回国就把你扣在海外留下来洋房稿费、国际地位要啥有啥，回国去一个刚打完仗，一穷二白的烂摊子，一边是唾手可得的安稳，一边是满目疮痍的故土，换做是你，你怎么选李四光的选择，以及他回国后干出的那些惊天动地的大事。咱们下集接着讲。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00001",
      "start_ms": 110,
      "end_ms": 3090,
      "text": "你十四岁那年在干啥？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00002",
      "start_ms": 4230,
      "end_ms": 5970,
      "text": "是不是还在爹妈跟前撒娇，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00003",
      "start_ms": 6790,
      "end_ms": 7290,
      "text": "考试，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00004",
      "start_ms": 7330,
      "end_ms": 8710,
      "text": "考砸了怕挨揍。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00005",
      "start_ms": 9710,
      "end_ms": 14770,
      "text": "可一九零二年湖北黄冈有个十四岁的穷小子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00006",
      "start_ms": 15230,
      "end_ms": 16129,
      "text": "干了一件事，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00007",
      "start_ms": 16510,
      "end_ms": 19190,
      "text": "把自己的名字填错了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00008",
      "start_ms": 19850,
      "end_ms": 22290,
      "text": "这孩子叫李仲坎爹，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00009",
      "start_ms": 22310,
      "end_ms": 23550,
      "text": "是个穷教书匠，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00010",
      "start_ms": 24030,
      "end_ms": 25530,
      "text": "家里穷的叮当响，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00011",
      "start_ms": 25970,
      "end_ms": 30000,
      "text": "连去武昌赶考的路费都是东拼西凑几了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00012",
      "start_ms": 30080,
      "end_ms": 30720,
      "text": "借来的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00013",
      "start_ms": 31120,
      "end_ms": 32920,
      "text": "到了考场填报名表，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00014",
      "start_ms": 33280,
      "end_ms": 34300,
      "text": "他太紧张，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00015",
      "start_ms": 34300,
      "end_ms": 35500,
      "text": "了手一抖，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00016",
      "start_ms": 36020,
      "end_ms": 39560,
      "text": "把年龄十四两个字写进了姓名栏。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00017",
      "start_ms": 39620,
      "end_ms": 41360,
      "text": "等他回过神坏了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00018",
      "start_ms": 41480,
      "end_ms": 42380,
      "text": "再买一张表，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00019",
      "start_ms": 43240,
      "end_ms": 45660,
      "text": "兜里的钱只够买这一张。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00020",
      "start_ms": 46480,
      "end_ms": 47760,
      "text": "你猜这孩子怎么办？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00021",
      "start_ms": 48660,
      "end_ms": 51520,
      "text": "他不慌盯着那个十字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00022",
      "start_ms": 51520,
      "end_ms": 52240,
      "text": "看了半天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00023",
      "start_ms": 53120,
      "end_ms": 55660,
      "text": "提笔添了几笔兴生生，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00024",
      "start_ms": 55700,
      "end_ms": 58160,
      "text": "把十改成了笔姓，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00025",
      "start_ms": 58240,
      "end_ms": 59080,
      "text": "有了名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00026",
      "start_ms": 59080,
      "end_ms": 59855,
      "text": "还空着。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00027",
      "start_ms": 60290,
      "end_ms": 61190,
      "text": "他一抬头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00028",
      "start_ms": 61450,
      "end_ms": 63885,
      "text": "看见厅堂上方挂着一块匾，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00029",
      "start_ms": 64340,
      "end_ms": 67235,
      "text": "上写光背四表四个大字。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00030",
      "start_ms": 67800,
      "end_ms": 69655,
      "text": "他摘下最后一个光子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00031",
      "start_ms": 70170,
      "end_ms": 74820,
      "text": "随手把自己的名字定成了李四光一张填错的表，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00032",
      "start_ms": 74920,
      "end_ms": 76905,
      "text": "一个将错就错的名字。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00033",
      "start_ms": 77710,
      "end_ms": 82615,
      "text": "谁能想到这个穷小子情急之下改的名字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00034",
      "start_ms": 83170,
      "end_ms": 86735,
      "text": "日后会刻进新中国的史册，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00035",
      "start_ms": 87660,
      "end_ms": 88735,
      "text": "名字是错的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00036",
      "start_ms": 89670,
      "end_ms": 92505,
      "text": "可他这辈子走的路一步都没走错。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00037",
      "start_ms": 93090,
      "end_ms": 95645,
      "text": "李四光小时候跟着爹念私塾，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00038",
      "start_ms": 96080,
      "end_ms": 97645,
      "text": "有一回在村口玩儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00039",
      "start_ms": 98020,
      "end_ms": 101405,
      "text": "看见一块孤零零的大石头比人还高。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00040",
      "start_ms": 102240,
      "end_ms": 103675,
      "text": "他就跑去问先生，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00041",
      "start_ms": 104270,
      "end_ms": 105795,
      "text": "这石头是从哪儿来的？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00042",
      "start_ms": 106150,
      "end_ms": 107230,
      "text": "先生答不上来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00043",
      "start_ms": 107490,
      "end_ms": 108715,
      "text": "就这么一个问题。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00044",
      "start_ms": 109580,
      "end_ms": 112740,
      "text": "在他心里扎了根很多年后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00045",
      "start_ms": 112920,
      "end_ms": 117255,
      "text": "他才明白自己这辈子就是想去回答一句话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00046",
      "start_ms": 118000,
      "end_ms": 121925,
      "text": "脚下这片土地到底藏着什么？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00047",
      "start_ms": 122820,
      "end_ms": 127565,
      "text": "十五岁李四光公费去日本留学，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00048",
      "start_ms": 128790,
      "end_ms": 129645,
      "text": "学造船，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00049",
      "start_ms": 132040,
      "end_ms": 133115,
      "text": "为啥学造船？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00050",
      "start_ms": 133670,
      "end_ms": 134675,
      "text": "说出来扎心。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00051",
      "start_ms": 135200,
      "end_ms": 138195,
      "text": "那时候的中国海防烂得一塌糊涂，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00052",
      "start_ms": 138690,
      "end_ms": 141975,
      "text": "列强的军舰在长江里横冲直撞。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00053",
      "start_ms": 142320,
      "end_ms": 144225,
      "text": "跟逛自家后花园似的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00054",
      "start_ms": 144910,
      "end_ms": 148145,
      "text": "一个十几岁的孩子心里憋着一口气，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00055",
      "start_ms": 149160,
      "end_ms": 151965,
      "text": "造船强国把海防守住。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00056",
      "start_ms": 152430,
      "end_ms": 153370,
      "text": "一九零五年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00057",
      "start_ms": 153570,
      "end_ms": 156340,
      "text": "孙中山在东京筹建同盟会，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00058",
      "start_ms": 156420,
      "end_ms": 159160,
      "text": "李四光由孙中山亲自主盟，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00059",
      "start_ms": 159200,
      "end_ms": 162775,
      "text": "加入成了最年轻的创始会员之一。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00060",
      "start_ms": 163590,
      "end_ms": 164910,
      "text": "孙中山握着他的手，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00061",
      "start_ms": 165230,
      "end_ms": 166415,
      "text": "送了他八个字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00062",
      "start_ms": 166800,
      "end_ms": 170890,
      "text": "努力向学未为国用这八个字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00063",
      "start_ms": 171050,
      "end_ms": 175525,
      "text": "像烙铁一样烫进了他心里一趟就是一辈子。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00064",
      "start_ms": 176440,
      "end_ms": 178120,
      "text": "一九一零年毕业回国，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00065",
      "start_ms": 178440,
      "end_ms": 179955,
      "text": "辛亥革命一爆发，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00066",
      "start_ms": 180310,
      "end_ms": 184995,
      "text": "二十二岁的李四光当上了湖北军政府事业部部长。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00067",
      "start_ms": 185510,
      "end_ms": 186605,
      "text": "二十二岁呀，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00068",
      "start_ms": 186960,
      "end_ms": 187755,
      "text": "多大的官儿？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00069",
      "start_ms": 188630,
      "end_ms": 194010,
      "text": "搁今天那是省不级换做别人嗯，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00070",
      "start_ms": 194210,
      "end_ms": 195270,
      "text": "少年得志，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00071",
      "start_ms": 195350,
      "end_ms": 196545,
      "text": "那还不得飘起来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00072",
      "start_ms": 196930,
      "end_ms": 198370,
      "text": "可李四光干了没多久，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00073",
      "start_ms": 198710,
      "end_ms": 199755,
      "text": "心就凉了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00074",
      "start_ms": 200390,
      "end_ms": 202755,
      "text": "民国初年的官场乌烟瘴气，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00075",
      "start_ms": 203100,
      "end_ms": 204235,
      "text": "他算看明白了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00076",
      "start_ms": 204630,
      "end_ms": 207735,
      "text": "光靠造几艘船办几个工厂，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00077",
      "start_ms": 208180,
      "end_ms": 210715,
      "text": "救不了这个病入膏肓的国家。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00078",
      "start_ms": 211680,
      "end_ms": 212200,
      "text": "于是，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00079",
      "start_ms": 212480,
      "end_ms": 215305,
      "text": "他做了一个让所有人都看不懂的决定，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00080",
      "start_ms": 216270,
      "end_ms": 217095,
      "text": "辞掉部长，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00081",
      "start_ms": 217930,
      "end_ms": 221185,
      "text": "一九一三年再去英国留学，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00082",
      "start_ms": 222080,
      "end_ms": 223665,
      "text": "放着好好的官不做，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00083",
      "start_ms": 224060,
      "end_ms": 225200,
      "text": "跑去洋人的地盘，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00084",
      "start_ms": 225220,
      "end_ms": 226940,
      "text": "从头学起屠杀。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00085",
      "start_ms": 227430,
      "end_ms": 229650,
      "text": "图的是国家缺什么？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00086",
      "start_ms": 229710,
      "end_ms": 230650,
      "text": "他就学什么？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00087",
      "start_ms": 230670,
      "end_ms": 232250,
      "text": "到了英国伯明汉大学，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00088",
      "start_ms": 232570,
      "end_ms": 233815,
      "text": "他先学采矿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00089",
      "start_ms": 234190,
      "end_ms": 236385,
      "text": "为啥中国地大物博，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00090",
      "start_ms": 236720,
      "end_ms": 238655,
      "text": "可怜钢铁都要靠进口，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00091",
      "start_ms": 239060,
      "end_ms": 239800,
      "text": "要强国，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00092",
      "start_ms": 240260,
      "end_ms": 242765,
      "text": "先得把地底下的矿挖出来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00093",
      "start_ms": 244020,
      "end_ms": 245065,
      "text": "可学了一年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00094",
      "start_ms": 245590,
      "end_ms": 247675,
      "text": "他又发现一个更要命的问题。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00095",
      "start_ms": 248730,
      "end_ms": 249365,
      "text": "矿在哪？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00096",
      "start_ms": 250410,
      "end_ms": 252525,
      "text": "地底下到底埋着什么，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00097",
      "start_ms": 253450,
      "end_ms": 254035,
      "text": "怎么找？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00098",
      "start_ms": 254960,
      "end_ms": 257815,
      "text": "要找矿得先懂地制。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00099",
      "start_ms": 259040,
      "end_ms": 264255,
      "text": "于是他第二次转向从采矿转到地址。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00100",
      "start_ms": 264760,
      "end_ms": 265785,
      "text": "你看他这几步，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00101",
      "start_ms": 266490,
      "end_ms": 269485,
      "text": "造船、采矿、地质，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00102",
      "start_ms": 269860,
      "end_ms": 271260,
      "text": "哪一步是为了自己，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00103",
      "start_ms": 271400,
      "end_ms": 272980,
      "text": "哪一步是哪个热门学，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00104",
      "start_ms": 272980,
      "end_ms": 274190,
      "text": "哪个没有，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00105",
      "start_ms": 274600,
      "end_ms": 276000,
      "text": "全是国家缺什么，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00106",
      "start_ms": 276080,
      "end_ms": 277485,
      "text": "他就扑上去学什么，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00107",
      "start_ms": 278010,
      "end_ms": 281025,
      "text": "一个少年的名字是填表填错的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00108",
      "start_ms": 281630,
      "end_ms": 283305,
      "text": "可他这一生的志向，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00109",
      "start_ms": 283780,
      "end_ms": 284960,
      "text": "一次都没填，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00110",
      "start_ms": 284960,
      "end_ms": 285415,
      "text": "错过。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00111",
      "start_ms": 286270,
      "end_ms": 287310,
      "text": "拿到硕士后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00112",
      "start_ms": 287510,
      "end_ms": 292680,
      "text": "应蔡元培之邀李四光到北京大学当地质系教授。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00113",
      "start_ms": 292980,
      "end_ms": 294245,
      "text": "后来做了系主任，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00114",
      "start_ms": 295080,
      "end_ms": 295695,
      "text": "在北大，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00115",
      "start_ms": 296160,
      "end_ms": 297325,
      "text": "他干了三件事，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00116",
      "start_ms": 297800,
      "end_ms": 298860,
      "text": "渐渐打脸。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00117",
      "start_ms": 298960,
      "end_ms": 307695,
      "text": "洋人第一件研究停科化石停是一种早就灭绝的微小生物外壳。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00118",
      "start_ms": 308110,
      "end_ms": 310690,
      "text": "像纺锤不同年代长得不一样，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00119",
      "start_ms": 311310,
      "end_ms": 313970,
      "text": "李四光摸出一套鉴定方法，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00120",
      "start_ms": 314710,
      "end_ms": 315830,
      "text": "至今还在用。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00121",
      "start_ms": 316730,
      "end_ms": 317910,
      "text": "这东西有啥用？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00122",
      "start_ms": 318290,
      "end_ms": 319650,
      "text": "找煤的指南针，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00123",
      "start_ms": 320590,
      "end_ms": 323830,
      "text": "安徽一处煤矿眼看要踩空了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00124",
      "start_ms": 324250,
      "end_ms": 325810,
      "text": "他捡到一块停化石，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00125",
      "start_ms": 325810,
      "end_ms": 327310,
      "text": "翻来覆去一看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00126",
      "start_ms": 327310,
      "end_ms": 328370,
      "text": "底下还有煤，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00127",
      "start_ms": 328370,
      "end_ms": 331730,
      "text": "果然新煤田挖出来了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00128",
      "start_ms": 331730,
      "end_ms": 335610,
      "text": "第二件第四季冰川，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00129",
      "start_ms": 335610,
      "end_ms": 339080,
      "text": "当时外国全民袁为一口咬定，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00130",
      "start_ms": 339540,
      "end_ms": 341300,
      "text": "中国东部气候温暖，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00131",
      "start_ms": 341480,
      "end_ms": 344820,
      "text": "不可能有冰川李四光偏不信这个邪。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00132",
      "start_ms": 345240,
      "end_ms": 347280,
      "text": "带着学生翻山越岭，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00133",
      "start_ms": 347460,
      "end_ms": 351660,
      "text": "太行山大统、黄山、庐山一路找过去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00134",
      "start_ms": 351900,
      "end_ms": 353860,
      "text": "硬是找到了冰川遗迹，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00135",
      "start_ms": 354180,
      "end_ms": 357160,
      "text": "把洋人的定论翻了个底朝天。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00136",
      "start_ms": 357720,
      "end_ms": 360080,
      "text": "第三件创立地质力学，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00137",
      "start_ms": 360720,
      "end_ms": 362660,
      "text": "他把力学引进地质研究，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00138",
      "start_ms": 363120,
      "end_ms": 364880,
      "text": "提出构造体系。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00139",
      "start_ms": 365860,
      "end_ms": 368705,
      "text": "地壳上那些褶皱断裂，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00140",
      "start_ms": 368980,
      "end_ms": 369955,
      "text": "不是乱常的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00141",
      "start_ms": 370550,
      "end_ms": 373135,
      "text": "是地底下应力挤压出来的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00142",
      "start_ms": 373740,
      "end_ms": 375035,
      "text": "既然是挤出来的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00143",
      "start_ms": 375240,
      "end_ms": 378850,
      "text": "就能算能推能预测这个想法，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00144",
      "start_ms": 379030,
      "end_ms": 383655,
      "text": "后来成了中国找矿找由的一把总钥匙。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00145",
      "start_ms": 384510,
      "end_ms": 385285,
      "text": "说到这儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00146",
      "start_ms": 385930,
      "end_ms": 388730,
      "text": "李四光已经是国际知名的大学者，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00147",
      "start_ms": 388730,
      "end_ms": 390745,
      "text": "在英国站稳了脚跟，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00148",
      "start_ms": 391420,
      "end_ms": 393940,
      "text": "半生的研究手稿都整理好了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00149",
      "start_ms": 394100,
      "end_ms": 396435,
      "text": "就等出版人生到这儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00150",
      "start_ms": 396760,
      "end_ms": 398035,
      "text": "似乎可以圆满了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00151",
      "start_ms": 398620,
      "end_ms": 399515,
      "text": "可就在这时，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00152",
      "start_ms": 400120,
      "end_ms": 406085,
      "text": "一九四九年新中国成立的消息从大洋彼岸传来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00153",
      "start_ms": 406550,
      "end_ms": 408215,
      "text": "身在伦敦的李四光，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00154",
      "start_ms": 408630,
      "end_ms": 411790,
      "text": "一下子站到了人生最大的悬崖边上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00155",
      "start_ms": 412650,
      "end_ms": 414435,
      "text": "国民党特务放出狠话。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00156",
      "start_ms": 415070,
      "end_ms": 416090,
      "text": "不公开声明，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00157",
      "start_ms": 416090,
      "end_ms": 423330,
      "text": "不回国就把你扣在海外留下来洋房稿费、国际地位要啥有啥，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00158",
      "start_ms": 423570,
      "end_ms": 425650,
      "text": "回国去一个刚打完仗，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00159",
      "start_ms": 425990,
      "end_ms": 428025,
      "text": "一穷二白的烂摊子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00160",
      "start_ms": 428360,
      "end_ms": 430640,
      "text": "一边是唾手可得的安稳，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00161",
      "start_ms": 430920,
      "end_ms": 433625,
      "text": "一边是满目疮痍的故土，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00162",
      "start_ms": 434070,
      "end_ms": 434910,
      "text": "换做是你，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00163",
      "start_ms": 435210,
      "end_ms": 439155,
      "text": "你怎么选李四光的选择，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00164",
      "start_ms": 439670,
      "end_ms": 444325,
      "text": "以及他回国后干出的那些惊天动地的大事。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fef2893617317e67_s00165",
      "start_ms": 445080,
      "end_ms": 446695,
      "text": "咱们下集接着讲。"
    }
  ],
